{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Gutter guards are protective covers or screens that fit over or inside your gutters, allowing water to enter while blocking leaves, pine needles, twigs, and other debris. They work by creating a barrier that debris can't penetrate while still allowing rainwater to flow through.</p>

<p>Different types work better for different debris. Micro-mesh guards excel at blocking fine debris like pine needles and roof grit. Screen guards handle larger leaves effectively. Solid covers use surface tension to pull water in while debris slides off.</p>

<p>The right choice depends on your specific situation — what trees surround your home, your roof pitch, and your existing gutter system. We'll assess your home and recommend the best solution during your free estimate.</p>
{% endset %}

